{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-relics","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigRelic-33215","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-relics-item-ItemConfigRelic-33215-item-ItemConfigRelic-33215-0","text":"位面球中封装着哀丽秘榭的「迷路迷境」，拨开金色的麦草，掉进一片深深、深深的树洞，咦？好多小妖精，「一二三四五六七？」，错啦！是「哆徕咪发嗦啦嘻！」","speaker":""}]}
